9. HASH ALGORITHM NOTES
================================================================================

Current Implementation: SHA256
- Available via CMake: file(SHA256 ...)
- Available via OpenSSL: SHA256() function
- No additional dependencies required

Specified Standard: BLAKE3
- Per EPIC 10.2 specification: "BLAKE3 is the standard"
- Command b3sum: NOT FOUND on system
- Library: Not yet vendored

Migration Path:
1. Vendor BLAKE3 in vendors/blake3/
2. Update PhaseLock.cmake: Replace file(SHA256 ...) with execute_process(COMMAND b3sum ...)
3. Update PhaseLockVerifier.cpp: Replace SHA256() with BLAKE3()
4. Set PHASE_LOCK_HASH_ALGO=BLAKE3
5. Regenerate all manifests

Design Decision:
- Implemented with SHA256 for immediate functionality
- Abstracted via PHASE_LOCK_HASH_ALGO variable
- Easy swap to BLAKE3 when available (single-point change)

